---
---
<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-brand-cream" id="inicio">
  <!-- Decorative background elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-teal/10 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-70 translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/2"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-brand-green/10 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-70 -translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/5 text-brand-teal font-medium text-sm mb-8 border border-brand-teal/20 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-fill-mode: both;">
        <span class="relative flex h-3 w-3">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-brand-green opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-3 w-3 bg-brand-green"></span>
        </span>
        Tu empresa de software en Chivilcoy
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-blue mb-8 leading-tight opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-fill-mode: both;">
        Desarrollo de Software con <br class="hidden md:block"/>
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-teal to-brand-green">Toque Humano</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-brand-blue/70 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s; animation-fill-mode: both;">
        Transformamos ideas complejas en soluciones digitales de alto impacto, diseñadas desde Chivilcoy al mundo.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.6s; animation-fill-mode: both;">
        <a href="#contacto" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-brand-blue text-brand-cream rounded-full font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-brand-teal transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1">
          Comenzar Proyecto
        </a>
        <a href="#servicios" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue rounded-full font-semibold text-lg hover:border-brand-teal hover:text-brand-teal transition-all duration-300">
          Explorar Servicios
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
